<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>QUICKDATA GH | Fast Data. Better Prices.</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#071426;color:white}
header{padding:22px;background:#0d2038;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.logo{font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;color:#f5bd45}
.logo span{color:white}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:65px 20px}
.hero h1{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:15px}
.hero h1 span{color:#f5bd45}
.hero p{color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#f5bd45;color:#071426;padding:14px 25px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;margin-top:15px}
section{padding:25px 18px}
h2{text-align:center}
.networks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:15px}
.card{background:#122944;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center}
.card h3{font-size:23px}
.card p{color:#cbd5e1}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;color:#aab8ca}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">QUICKDATA <span>GH</span></div>
<div>🇬🇭 Ghana</div>
</header>

<div class="hero">
<h1>Fast Data. <span>Better Prices.</span></h1>
<p>Stay connected with affordable data bundles across Ghana.</p>
<p>MTN • Telecel • AT</p>
<a class="btn" href="#networks">Explore Data Bundles</a>
</div>

<section id="networks">
<h2>Choose Your Network</h2>
<div class="networks">
<div class="card">
<h3>🟡 MTN Ghana</h3>
<p>Affordable MTN data bundles.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🔴 Telecel</h3>
<p>Stay connected with Telecel data.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>🔵 AT Ghana</h3>
<p>Explore AT data packages.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<footer>
<p>QUICKDATA GH</p>
<p>Fast Data. Better Prices. Always Connected.</p>
<p>© 2026 QUICKDATA GH. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
